//! Frontier worlds (Wave 12 planets-b, expansion plan §16 WP-SPACE "planet themes"): the
//! **desert dunes**, **volcanic** and **crystal** planets, each a world like the home ground
//! level.
//!
//! Every body the space generator tags [`crate::space::Theme::DesertDunes`],
//! [`crate::space::Theme::Volcanic`] or [`crate::space::Theme::Crystal`] gets one of the three
//! ground themes registered here ([`DUNE_WORLD`], [`VOLCANIC_WORLD`], [`CRYSTAL_WORLD`] in the
//! planet theme registry, [`crate::planet::theme`]); its round ground is generated by the
//! polar track's [`crate::planet::PlanetGround`] with this module's hooks:
//!
//! * **A surface of its own** ([`generate::surface_height`]): rolling dunes with steep slip
//!   faces and oasis basins of water ringed by palms; basalt islands in lava seas under
//!   volcano cones (one of them the Caldera); gentle quartz hills bristling with crystal
//!   spires.
//! * **Four strata each** ([`desert::STRATA`], [`volcanic::STRATA`], [`crystal::STRATA`]) as
//!   concentric rings: the first three fill the body's authored depth ([`strata_rows`]:
//!   800-2,500 rows on a planet, scaled with the radius; a few hundred on a moon or crater
//!   rock) and the fourth runs on down to the core chamber. Each stratum has its materials
//!   ([`FrontierTile`]), its ores and **one signature rule** ([`StratumRule`]) that changes how
//!   it plays: sand that slides into tunnels, ruin floors that give way, galleries that carry
//!   a drill's noise to the wyrms, glass that shatters in chains, toxic ash air, lava-tube
//!   draughts, obsidian that splinters, searing magma heat, resonant crystal, light-beam
//!   vaults, regrowing geodes and a crushing heavy lattice.
//! * **A landmark** on every body ([`landmark`]: the Sleeping Sentinel, the Caldera, the Choir
//!   Spire), **one secret** on each crater rock or small moon ([`secret`]) and **a site for a
//!   friendly settlement** ([`settlement_site`], the aliens track's hook).
//! * **Hazards** tagged for the stations track's planet gear ([`PlanetHazard`]: heat, cold,
//!   toxic air, high gravity), **weather** ([`rules::weather_at`]: sandstorms, ash falls and
//!   eruptions, glitterfrost) and **creatures** (twelve [`crate::enemy::EnemyKind`]s, three
//!   neutral and one or two hostile per theme, `world/enemies/frontier.rs`).
//!
//! Generation is a pure function of the planet's params (seed, radius, theme): no platform
//! maths, integer noise only. The rules run in `world/frontier.rs` on whichever ground pass
//! holds a frontier planet's store (F11), single-player, split screen, online and in the
//! browser alike.

pub mod crystal;
pub mod desert;
pub mod generate;
pub mod rules;
#[cfg(test)]
mod tests;
pub mod volcanic;

